//ERR 9 12 9 13
//MSG="Continue depth has to be positive"

// The `cnt` half of 63e_break_level_of_zero.cpl. The two keywords are parsed by
// separate functions, so each rejects its own zero and each names itself in the
// message; testing only one would leave the other's arm uncovered.

fn main
    for i 0..3
        cnt 0
